"en"
:
"SiliconCloud official website: https://www.siliconflow.cn"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"- Get SiliconCloud API Key: https://cloud.siliconflow.cn/me/account/ak\n- Interactive env use `x siliconflow init` to initialize configuration. The configure will be saved locally.\n- Run command `x siliconflow --cfg apikey=<apikey>` to add access apikey.\n"
,
"zh"
:
"- 获取 SiliconCloud API Key: https://cloud.siliconflow.cn/me/account/ak\n- 交互环境中可使用 `x siliconflow init` 进行初始化配置，配置信息将存放于本地保存\n- 亦可运行命令 `x siliconflow --cfg apikey=<apikey>` 添加私人令牌\n"
}
]
